  "limits": "Not a fluid simulation: probes ignore hull shape and displaced volume, and waves are sums of sines without Gerstner sideways motion. Light default drag lets bodies bob for a while. The surface function must match any water shader you pair it with. Verified with Godot 4.7.2 headless; written against the Godot 4.3 API.",
